WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:09.378
When the chandelier fell, many people were injured, and one was killed: the woman

2
00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:18.590
hired to replace Madame Giry. After that horrible night, Madame Giry was rehired, Carlotta fell

3
00:00:18.591 --> 00:00:26.085
ill, and Christine disappeared. Almost two weeks passed, and Christine was not seen at

4
00:00:26.086 --> 00:00:31.857
the opera or anywhere else in Paris. Raoul, still recovering from his broken heart,

5
00:00:31.858 --> 00:00:39.015
was deeply worried. He wrote to her at Mama Valerius' apartment, where she lived, but

6
00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:47.169
received no reply. "I'll go to the opera house and talk to the managers,"

7
00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:56.076
Raoul said to himself. "They're sure to know where she is." When Raoul arrived at

8
00:00:56.077 --> 00:01:01.880
their office that afternoon, he found the managers looking as if they hadn't slept

9
00:01:01.881 --> 00:01:07.937
since the chandelier fell. They were pale, worried, and not especially happy to see

