00:01:09.011 --> 00:01:16.630
Raoul. "I'm wondering if you could tell me where Christine is," Raoul said politely. "She's taking a holiday," Moncharmin said. "Well, when will she be back?" "No idea," Richard

11
00:01:16.631 --> 00:01:21.872
said without looking up from his desk. "Christine requested a leave of absence for

12
00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:29.178
health reasons," Moncharmin said. "Oh no, she's ill!" Raoul cried. "What's the matter with her?"

13
00:01:29.179 --> 00:01:39.024
"We don't know," Richard said. "Is it her voice? Did you send the opera's physician to see her?" "No, she didn't ask for him, and we trust her to

