70
00:08:16.341 --> 00:08:23.228
"Christine!" he called. Suddenly she was pulled back, the window was closed, and the carriage

71
00:08:23.229 --> 00:08:29.794
dashed past Raoul. "Christine!" he called again as the carriage vanished into the night.

